From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: pending: ceb90d38eb (15.6.75.74, SHA-256 code-cache
 source hash)

V8 15.6.75.74 change from the 8078 branch: hash the full script source
(and wrapped arguments) with SHA-256 for code cache validation instead
of checking only the source length, shipped on by default. Applied to
15.6.75.66 the files are byte-identical to upstream .74. Waits for the
next release; the cache epoch is not bumped here. V8 gitlink unchanged.
